[conditions] owner-draft: proves a text sent while the owner's own unsent draft sits in the composer arrives in one turn after the draft, both character for character, with only spaces between - the owner's ruling of 21 October 2026, and what a person typing more gets. Cannot: how many spaces join the two is not judged: the prompt route adds one, a person types their own.
